{"id":"akkuratno","lemma":"аккуратно","pos":"adv","rank":2238,"glosses":["neatly, smartly","carefully, cautiously, prudently"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/56/Ru-%D0%B0%D0%BA%D0%BA%D1%83%D1%80%D0%B0%D1%82%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%B0%D0%BA%D0%BA%D1%83%D1%80%D0%B0%D1%82%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Делай это аккуратно.","en":"Do it carefully.","words":[{"g":"to make, to do","l":"делать"},{"g":"this / it is"},null]},{"text":"Я пытался сделать это аккуратно.","en":"I tried to do it carefully.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to attempt, to try","l":"пытаться"},{"g":"to make, to do"},{"g":"this / it is"},null]},{"text":"Это было довольно аккуратно.","en":"That was pretty neat.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"enough, sufficient"},null]},{"text":"Нам нужно сделать это очень аккуратно.","en":"We need to do this very carefully.","words":[{"g":"(to) us","l":"мы"},{"g":"it is necessary"},{"g":"to make, to do"},{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"very"},null]},{"text":"Он всегда аккуратно одет.","en":"He is always neatly dressed.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"always"},null,null]}]}